      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p><u><strong>If you want to be completely surprised by RC &amp; IR, please do not read any further.</strong></u></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>***********************************************************************************************************************************</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With the reprint of RC&amp;IR coming, i thought it would be appropriate to have an even around them. What I need is some challenges that use RC or IR. It doesn&#39;t matter what the challenge is. It could be just using a hero, beating someone, a full scenerio, it doesn&#39;t matter. The only requirement is that it has to have something from either RC or IR.</p><p>Just so we don&#39;t have one person giving 100 different challenges, each player can give up to 3: one easy, one medium, and one hard. Please list them in this thread, as well as <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheet/ccc?key=0AidOKG-M_yQmdHgwbnBKTlJmVlhyWUZ0V09GLTJvM1E&amp;usp=sharing\">here</a>.</p><p>If you want to try the challenges, simply put your name on top of the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheet/ccc?key=0AidOKG-M_yQmdHgwbnBKTlJmVlhyWUZ0V09GLTJvM1E&amp;usp=sharing\">spreadsheet</a>, and indicate which challenges you have completed.</p><p>Becauase different people will be getting the game at different times, this event will go until January 2nd, so you have plenty of time to play everything.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Have fun everyone!</span></p>",
