      "created_at": "2013-12-17T20:58:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Easy</p><p>End a game with NightMist at full health.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Medium</p><p>Defeat Akash'Bhuta without the heroes dealing damage to her directly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>Hard</em></p><p>Allow all Ennead members to enter play and defeat them before the setup card flips, while using only heroes from RC and IR. (you are still allowed to incap members of the Ennead before more come into play)</p>",
