      "id": 84564,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-12-17T21:03:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I want to do more than 3!!! &nbsp;Curse you Pydro and your sensible restrictions!!</p><p>Theme Challenges are the way to go.</p><p>Easy:</p><p>Man vs. Nature: &nbsp;Defeat Akash'Bhutah in Pike Industrial Complex</p><p>Medium:</p><p>Sin City: &nbsp;Defeat Apostate in Rook City.</p><p>Hard:</p><p>Parricide: &nbsp;In Tomb of Anubis vs. the Ennead have Anubis defeat both Nephthys and Osiris.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Crossing over the expansions for the first two (with cool themes) and the last is just awesome, and the two best heroes to do it with are in the combined set.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:07:58.320Z",
