      "id": 84565,
      "name": "Envisioner",
      "username": "Envisioner",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-12-17T21:46:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Easy</p><p>Defeat Apostate while allowing him to flip at least once, and then again without him ever flipping (or vice versa).&nbsp; You need not use the same Heroes or Environment.</p><p>Medium</p><p>Have Nightmist get at least 30 cards into her hand.</p><p>Difficult</p><p>On Advanced, have the team of Fixer, Nightmist and Argent Adept - no other heroes - defeat their nemeses in three consecutive battles in the same Environment.&nbsp; All cards except those of the villains remain in play between matches and all HP totals are retained; any hero incapacitated in a battle begins the next battle alive at 1 HP with a new starting hand.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
