      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I added an Extreme category for ones I&#39;ve done, but are harder than the normal hard ones.</p><p>Easy:</p><p>Unload!: &nbsp;Fire all five of Expat&#39;s guns in one Unload.</p><p>Medium:</p><p style=\"font-size: 12.800000190734863px; line-height: 20px;\">Praise God and Pass the Ammunition: &nbsp;Use four or more Ammo cards in one turn. &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12.800000190734863px;\">I&#39;m No Villain (character card): &nbsp;Have the Operative destroy the Chairman</span></p><p>Hard:</p><p style=\"font-size: 12.800000190734863px; line-height: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.800000190734863px;\">Full Assault: &nbsp;Use all Six of Expat&#39;s Weapons (Guns+RPG Launcher) on someone else&#39;s turn.</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12.800000190734863px; line-height: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.800000190734863px;\">Safety Week: &nbsp;Defeat Plague Rat in Pike Industrial Complex without heroes destroying an environment card.</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12.800000190734863px; line-height: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.800000190734863px;\">Slight of Hand: &nbsp;As Argent Adept have other heroes play 5 cards during your turn.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12.800000190734863px;\">EXTREME!!!</span></p><p>No Animals were Harmed: &nbsp;Defeat the Matriarch when no hero target deals damage to a fowl card. &nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size: 12.800000190734863px; line-height: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.800000190734863px;\">Flower Power: &nbsp;Defeat Akash&#39;bhuta when no hero target but The Argent Adept deals damage to a villain target.</span></p><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>The three Expat challenges I pulled off at once, vs. Akash. &nbsp;Expat ended up Lowest HP and stayed there for 5 rounds while three different brambles pinned me down. &nbsp;My friends didn&#39;t seem too worried about it, with Speed Loading and Load putting cards in play and Salvage Yard and TLT feeding me cards I was well prepared. &nbsp;As soon as the brambles were gone Adept let me play Unload, I had all 5 guns, RPG Launcher in hand and 6 ammo cards in play. &nbsp;It was nice.</div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
